    contract: Human Quorum / Unbound
    text: 'Archive custody, Human Quorum / Unbound: A human quorum takes the signing seats. The protocol must answer to named people whose decisions can be challenged. The release reaches every district at once. It breaks the old consensus and leaves difficult repairs for the survivors. A second copy carries a hand-written objection to the official disposition.'
